      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "P016 supplies the joint expansion requirements; P014 specifies the referenced bounds."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C035_SIGNAL",
    "value": "Compare explanations using evidence assessed for reliability and diagnostic value, test sensitivity to uncertain measurements and combined causes, and observe whether the canary changes the predicted phase and overall tail without increasing failures or unfinished exports. Assess compliance with predefined operating bounds using adequate exposure and coverage.",
    "scope": "A gate for expanding the targeted mitigation against comparable baseline traffic. Inadequate exposure or coverage makes the canary inconclusive; a short clean canary cannot establish resolution.",
